{
  "slug": "clearspeech",
  "name": "Clearspeech",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Always-on communication layer for people with aphasia — rewrites unclear messages before Claude acts. Supports English, French, and German. No backend, no API key required.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `clearspeech` (ALWAYS-ON input clarifier for a user with aphasia).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install clearspeech@claude-community` from `JulieGoulet2/clearspeech-skill-`.\n\nA skill for Claude Code that helps people with aphasia or other communication difficulties express themselves clearly.",
